  ('04548ab7-7613-5958-a5d0-f7af987babc6'::uuid, 7, 'Computer Hardware', 'medium', 'In Indian homes and school labs, a small box called a UPS is connected to desktop PCs. Why is it useful?', 'It provides short battery backup during a power cut so you can save your work safely', 'It prints color photos', 'It cleans computer viruses', 'It makes games run faster', 'a', 'In Indian homes and school labs, a small box called a UPS is connected to desktop PCs. Why is it useful?', 'It provides short battery backup during a power cut so you can save your work safely', 'It increases the speed of games by adding extra working memory to the connected computer system', 'It gives the computer a faster internet connection by creating a new private wireless network at home', 'It cleans malware from every stored file whenever power is switched on'),
