  ('50fbf68c-160a-56b0-a921-176807c558cb'::uuid, 11, 'Basic Networking & Connectivity', 'easy', 'On a laptop connected to someone’s mobile Hotspot, turning ON "Metered Connection" (or Data Saver) helps because:', 'It doubles keyboard speed', 'It pauses huge background Windows updates so your friend’s mobile data does not drain suddenly', 'It makes the screen brighter', 'It uninstalls browsers', 'b', 'On a laptop connected to someone’s mobile Hotspot, turning ON "Metered Connection" (or Data Saver) helps because:', 'It permanently doubles keyboard speed whenever the laptop uses a mobile hotspot', 'It can limit large background updates and downloads, helping reduce mobile data use.', 'It increases the brightness of the laptop screen and keeps the display awake for longer', 'It uninstalls all browsers automatically so the laptop cannot use the internet connection'),
  ('e0b72d58-1fa7-58be-ae34-6065dc506a35'::uuid, 11, 'Basic Networking & Connectivity', 'easy', 'On modern dual-band home Wi-Fi routers, you often see two Wi-Fi names: `Home_2.4G` and `Home_5G`. What is the practical difference?', 'There is no difference at all', '`5G` Wi-Fi requires a 5G SIM card inside the router', '`5 GHz` gives faster speeds nearby in the same room; `2.4 GHz` reaches farther through walls', '`2.4G` works only at 2:40 PM', 'c', 'On modern dual-band home Wi-Fi routers, you often see two Wi-Fi names: `Home_2.4G` and `Home_5G`. What is the practical difference?', 'Both networks always have the same speed and range, regardless of walls or distance', 'The 5 GHz Wi-Fi network works only if the home router has a 5G mobile SIM card inside', '`5 GHz` gives faster speeds nearby in the same room; `2.4 GHz` reaches farther through walls', 'The 2.4 GHz wireless network works only when the current time is exactly 2:40 in the afternoon'),
