  ('ee739573-80ff-59fe-861a-838f80684481'::uuid, 12, 'Web Browsing & Internet', 'hard', 'When sharing a Google Doc with a teammate, what is the difference between giving "Commenter" access vs "Editor" access?', 'An Editor cannot type anything', 'A Commenter can suggest notes without changing your original text; an Editor can directly change or delete content', 'A Commenter cannot even read the document', 'Both are identical', 'b', 'When sharing a Google Doc with a teammate, what is the difference between giving "Commenter" access vs "Editor" access?', 'A Commenter and an Editor have identical permissions, so both can change or delete any of the original content', 'A Commenter can suggest notes without changing your original text; an Editor can directly change or delete content', 'A Commenter cannot read the document at all, whereas an Editor can only view it without changing the text', 'A Commenter can delete the shared document, while an Editor cannot type or change its original text'),
  ('ed3d721a-ce0f-5580-9dac-d0f3a928a8a1'::uuid, 12, 'Web Browsing & Internet', 'hard', 'Why do most email services (like Gmail) stop direct attachments larger than 25 MB, and how do you send a 200 MB project video cleanly?', 'Videos can never be shared online', 'Cut the video into 200 separate 1-second emails', 'Email inboxes aren’t built for huge files — upload the video to Google Drive/OneDrive and share its link instead', 'Rename `.mp4` to `.txt` so it shrinks to zero', 'c', 'Why do most email services (like Gmail) stop direct attachments larger than 25 MB, and how do you send a 200 MB project video cleanly?', 'Do not send the video at all because video files can never be shared through any online service or cloud link', 'Rename the MP4 file to TXT, which compresses the video to zero bytes while preserving its full picture and sound', 'Email inboxes aren’t built for huge files — upload the video to Google Drive/OneDrive and share its link instead', 'Split the file into hundreds of one-second attachments because email automatically combines them back into one video'),
