  ('95d813de-4bcf-5b52-b93e-8d5cc18522f5'::uuid, 12, 'Basic Networking & Connectivity', 'easy', 'On a laptop connected to someone’s mobile Hotspot, turning ON "Metered Connection" (or Data Saver) helps because:', 'It pauses huge background Windows updates so your friend’s mobile data does not drain suddenly', 'It makes the screen brighter', 'It doubles keyboard speed', 'It uninstalls browsers', 'a', 'On a laptop connected to someone’s mobile Hotspot, turning ON "Metered Connection" (or Data Saver) helps because:', 'It can limit large background updates and downloads, helping reduce mobile data use.', 'It increases the brightness of the laptop screen and keeps the display awake for longer', 'It permanently doubles keyboard speed whenever the laptop uses a mobile hotspot', 'It uninstalls all browsers automatically so the laptop cannot use the internet connection'),
