  ('fad6894a-171b-5d08-a679-43d03300f23c'::uuid, 12, 'Basic Networking & Connectivity', 'medium', 'What is the role of a "Firewall" in Windows or a school router?', 'It prevents physical fire in the computer room', 'It heats up the CPU in winter', 'It deletes old browser bookmarks', 'It monitors incoming and outgoing network traffic and blocks unauthorized outside connections', 'd', 'What is the role of a "Firewall" in Windows or a school router?', 'It prevents physical fires by cutting power to the whole building whenever network traffic increases', 'It assigns web addresses to every website on the internet and stores them permanently on your computer', 'It searches local storage and deletes every malicious file without checking network connections at all', 'It monitors incoming and outgoing network traffic and blocks unauthorized outside connections'),
  ('6e54bcc3-2951-5769-8084-3c1f02a31959'::uuid, 12, 'Basic Networking & Connectivity', 'medium', 'Why should you change the default admin login (`admin / admin`) printed on the bottom sticker of a new home Wi-Fi router?', 'Default passwords use more electricity', 'Anyone connected nearby who knows common default logins could open router settings and change your Wi-Fi or DNS!', 'Otherwise Wi-Fi turns off after 24 hours', 'It voids the monitor warranty', 'b', 'Why should you change the default admin login (`admin / admin`) printed on the bottom sticker of a new home Wi-Fi router?', 'Changing the router login makes every connected computer immune to all malware and viruses on the internet forever', 'Anyone connected nearby who knows common default logins could open router settings and change your Wi-Fi or DNS!', 'The manufacturer''s default login disables internet access after twenty-four hours unless it is changed', 'The default login increases electricity use and makes the router''s power supply consume extra current'),
  ('d1c7f240-92ff-5404-b235-4ea3a003f6ae'::uuid, 12, 'Basic Networking & Connectivity', 'hard', 'When setting a Wi-Fi security type on a modern router, why should you pick `WPA2` or `WPA3` instead of `"Open"` or old `"WEP"`?', 'Security settings only change router LED color', '`Open` is the most secure setting', '`WPA2` / `WPA3` strongly encrypt your wireless Wi-Fi traffic, whereas Open/WEP are insecure', '`WPA3` blocks your own laptop from connecting', 'c', 'When setting a Wi-Fi security type on a modern router, why should you pick `WPA2` or `WPA3` instead of `"Open"` or old `"WEP"`?', 'Security settings only change the colour and pattern of the indicator lights on the wireless router', 'The Open setting encrypts all traffic more securely than WPA2 or WPA3 on any modern wireless network', 'WPA2 / WPA3 encrypt Wi-Fi traffic with modern security, whereas Open networks and WEP are less secure', 'WPA3 blocks the owner''s devices permanently and makes it impossible to connect an authorized laptop'),
